    {
      "text": "2020 充满激情的创业",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724200719",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "26px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "39px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(224, 65, 3)"
    },
    {
      "text": "我们的创办人Tina看到高速电机在家电领域革新的增长机会，创办了LBH, 组建团队研发设计落地了第一款高速吹风机，从而启动了业务。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724200718",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "30px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "2021 教训的挫折",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724200728",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "26px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "39px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(224, 65, 3)"
    },
    {
      "text": "艰难前行，产品不成熟出现问题，第一批产品面向市场后，客户反馈在温度、各项模式上缺少选择，这给我们上了一课，加大研发投入是在竞争中生存的唯一途径。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724200727",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "30px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "2022 挫折中反弹",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724200731",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "26px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "39px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(224, 65, 3)"
    },
    {
      "text": "组建了更系统的专家团队，对供应商采用严格的筛选流程，以完善我们的供应系统。 LBH也研究了新兴市场，使我们能够优化或升级我们的产品，完善我们的品质控制体系，并建立稳固的企业文化,全新一代的高速吹风机落地并实现了量产。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724200730",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "30px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "2023 强劲的前进步伐",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724200734",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "26px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "39px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(224, 65, 3)"
    },
    {
      "text": "完成了生产制造、营销团队、质量测评、知识产权等供应链体系；建立了内部研发中心，并确定我们自己的产品定位；销售部也发展迅速，设立了五场PK赛。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724200733",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "30px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "2024 效能飙升",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724200725",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "26px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "39px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(224, 65, 3)"
    },
    {
      "text": "LBH在开发北美市场方面全力以赴，我们继续发展并对接到了北美最知名的品牌；在争夺销量最高的10家公司的竞标中，LBH电器成为该品牌2024年的获胜者，营业额突破5000万。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724200724",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "30px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "2025 快速进步",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724200722",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "26px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "39px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(224, 65, 3)"
    },
    {
      "text": "第一季度销售额突破2000万，同时开展了个护家电新品的研发落地与品类的扩充，进行了多项测试，LBH也和顶级供应商建立了长期的业务关系，以改善我们的供应链和运营工作。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724200721",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "30px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "2026 持续探索寻求突破",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724200715",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "26px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "39px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(224, 65, 3)"
    },
    {
      "text": "欧洲与中东地区开启新的市场拓展，会同时落地2-3款颠覆性个护家电产品，拓展全球本土化品牌合作伙伴，2026年我们将持续在个护小家电产品上进行研发投入，并将在未来继续这样做。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724200714",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
